# Duplicate routes collapsed onto one canonical URL each. Every one of these
# shipped byte-identical page source (except /project, an older copy of the
# projects page), so each was a second indexable URL competing with the real
# one. Nothing in the site linked to them, but they may be bookmarked or
# indexed, so they redirect rather than 404.
#
# /blogs/details was the single hand-built article page every blog card linked
# to. Its article is now /blogs/inside-the-logic-ic-trainer-kit-16-profiles,
# one of twenty, so the old URL redirects onto it rather than 404ing.
#
# Workers static assets reads this from the assets directory; Next copies
# public/ into out/ on export.
/blog              /blogs             301
/blog/details      /blogs/inside-the-logic-ic-trainer-kit-16-profiles  301
/blogs/details     /blogs/inside-the-logic-ic-trainer-kit-16-profiles  301
/life              /life-at-innosino  301
/life-in-innosino  /life-at-innosino  301
/privacy           /privacy-policy    301
/project           /projects          301
/project/details   /projects/details  301
